{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Materialize accepted boolean coercions before registration.** This accepts strings for `ContextOptions.ReplayChildren`, but only integers are subsequently normalized, so `\"false\"` is stored as a truthy string. Lambda deserializes it to boolean `false`; locally, completed contexts therefore retain and replay children instead of pruning them. Normalize `ReplayChildren` using the service's conversion before registration and add a replay/pruning regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-25XR","finding_digest":"649f037ed817beb5c0a1691f0bbc88df14bbb36fb7debbb64743ee44608f3853","finding_id":"arf_v1_mspqg7wyc67llqfbnepqxpei34","finding_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-update-serialization::scalarerror::boolean-coercion-not-propagated","identity_key":"checkpoint-server/validate-update-serialization::scalarerror::boolean-coercion-not-propagated","line":111,"observation_digest":"151c5ef3407d8970ea52fa0667cdc79bff43883abf78a4a81d7c9a28b74674b3","observation_id":"aro_v1_cuof542apwexb2ss7idgptohtp","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-testing/src/checkpoint-server/validators/validate-update-serialization.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T20:18:19Z","review_id":"arr_v1_osfmytb6dexq4ahqmyzgw5374j","reviewed_base_sha":"240ab1de57d6b46af70a0fc9f4d97d84c55930e0","reviewed_head_sha":"2be44452346e035f46c586f7502eb30c8c42cfb2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":107,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":996},"record_id":"art_v1_5hzcdlc3ojafuumnsnwaj5vk2f","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T20:18:19Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
